original_text: ["Activated abilities of creatures cost {1} less to activate. This effect can't reduce the amount of mana an ability costs to activate to less than one mana.", 'All Sliver creatures get +1/+1.', 'All Sliver creatures get +2/+2.', 'All Sliver creatures have "Whenever this creature is dealt damage, put a +1/+1 counter on it."', 'All Sliver creatures have "{2}: This creature gets +0/+1 until end of turn."', 'All Sliver creatures have "{2}: This creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn."', 'All Sliver creatures have "{2}: This creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn."', 'All Sliver creatures have double strike.', 'All Sliver creatures have flying.', "All Sliver creatures have frenzy 1. (Whenever a Sliver attacks and isn't blocked, it gets +1/+0 until end of turn.)", 'All Sliver creatures have haste.', 'All Sliver creatures have poisonous 1. (Whenever a Sliver deals combat damage to a player, that player gets a poison counter. A player with ten or more poison counters loses the game.)', 'All Slivers have "Pay 2 life: Return this permanent to its owner\'s hand."', 'All Slivers have "{2}, Sacrifice this permanent: This permanent deals 2 damage to target creature or player."', 'All Slivers have "{2}, Sacrifice this permanent: You gain 4 life."', 'All Slivers have "{2}: Regenerate this permanent."', 'All Slivers have "{3}, Sacrifice this permanent: Destroy target permanent."', 'All Slivers have "{T}: Add one mana of any color to your mana pool."', 'All Slivers have shroud.', 'B', 'Changeling (This card is every creature type at all times.)\\n{T}: Target creature gains all creature types until end of turn.\\n{T}: Target creature loses all creature types until end of turn.', 'Choose a creature type. Draw a card for each permanent you control of that type.', "Each Sliver card in each player's hand has slivercycling {3}.\\nSlivercycling {3} ({3}, Discard this card: Search your library for a Sliver card, reveal it, and put it into your hand. Then shuffle your library.)", 'Each creature gets +1/+1 for each other creature on the battlefield that shares at least one creature type with it.', 'Flash\\nAny player may cast Sliver cards as though they had flash.', 'G', 'R', 'Return up to three target creature cards of the creature type of your choice from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Rootbound Crag enters the battlefield tapped unless you control a Mountain or a Forest.\\n{T}: Add {R} or {G} to your mana pool.', 'Rupture Spire enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Rupture Spire enters the battlefield, sacrifice it unless you pay {1}.\\n{T}: Add one mana of any color to your mana pool.', 'U', 'Vivid Creek enters the battlefield tapped with two charge counters on it.\\n{T}: Add {U} to your mana pool.\\n{T}, Remove a charge counter from Vivid Creek: Add one mana of any color to your mana pool.', 'Vivid Grove enters the battlefield tapped with two charge counters on it.\\n{T}: Add {G} to your mana pool.\\n{T}, Remove a charge counter from Vivid Grove: Add one mana of any color to your mana pool.', 'W', 'Whenever a Sliver becomes blocked, that Sliver gets +1/+1 until end of turn for each creature blocking it.', 'Whenever a Sliver deals combat damage to a player, its controller may put a 1/1 colorless Sliver creature token onto the battlefield.', 'Whenever a creature enters the battlefield, if you cast it from your hand, you may search your library for a creature card with the same total power and toughness, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle your library.', '{3}: Search your library for a Sliver card, reveal that card, and put it into your hand. Then shuffle your library.\\n{3}: Gain control of target Sliver.', '{T}, Sacrifice Terramorphic Expanse: Search your library for a basic land card and put it onto the battlefield tapped. Then shuffle your library.', '{T}: Add one mana of any color to your mana pool. Spend this mana only to cast creature spells.']
original_type: ['Artifact', 'Artifact Creature — Sliver', 'Basic Land — Forest', 'Basic Land — Island', 'Basic Land — Mountain', 'Basic Land — Plains', 'Basic Land — Swamp', 'Creature — Fungus Sliver', 'Creature — Shapeshifter', 'Creature — Sliver', 'Creature — Sliver Spirit', 'Enchantment', 'Land', 'Legendary Creature — Sliver Mutant', 'Sorcery']
